# PDP Next Grid System

- **Mobile** `12/12/4` — 12 cols · 12px margin · 4px gutter · 375px
- **Desktop** `24/20/8` — 24 cols · 20px margin · 8px gutter · 1440px

Use `PageShell`, `PageGrid`, `GridItem` from `@/components/grid/page-grid`. No arbitrary page padding or custom column counts.

- Grid: `docs/design-system/grid.md` · skill `.cursor/skills/pdp-grid-system/SKILL.md`
- Type: Helvetica Neue LT Pro · `docs/design-system/typography.md`
- Icons: Material Symbols via `@/components/icons/material-icon` · `docs/design-system/icons.md`
